Package: khoneycomb
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: KDE Plasma 6 application launcher widget, a honeycomb of hexagons
 KHoneycomb fills one widget with a whole configurable grid of hexagon
 launcher tiles, tiled edge-to-edge. Adjustable neumorphic 3D bevel,
 optional background image, per-tile icon/command/zoom/color, and
 drag-to-reorder. Translated into German, Spanish, French and Russian.
